{"id": "d001-001", "text": "Noor's dad passed away on Sunday. Funeral is Thursday at 11 at the crematorium, wake at the Red Lion afterwards. Remind me to send her a card the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 11", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wake at the Red Lion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d001-002", "text": "chidi got made redundant fri, whole team gone. says hes fine but didnt sound it. meeting w HR monday 10am about the package", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "fri", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting w HR", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "monday 10am", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "d001-003", "text": "Helen is obsessed with Wolves at the moment, has a season ticket now and goes with her brother Rhys every home game. Wants the new away shirt for her birthday, which is sometime in March I think.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Wolves", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a season ticket", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants the new away shirt", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in March", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d001-004", "text": "Hana and Wiremu have split up. She's moving back in with her mum next weekend. Need to check in on her the week after once she's settled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in on her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after once she's settled", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d001-005", "text": "Zhang plays go competitively, apparently ranked 3 dan. Tournament in Manchester the 12th at half 9, he's quite nervous about it. Text him good luck that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "go", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "ranked 3 dan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Tournament in Manchester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d001-006", "text": "Coffee with Dorota. She's been knitting a blanket for her niece for about six months, nearly done. Her niece Ioana is due in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knitting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "niece", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "d001-007", "text": "Luca said his nan died last week. Funeral's sometime after Christmas because the family are all flying in from Italy. He's really struggling. They were close, she basically raised him while his parents worked. He's taking some time off work and might go over to Turin for a bit in the new year to help sort the house. Keep an eye on him, maybe take him for a pint at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "close", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "basically raised him", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "time off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go over to Turin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Keep an eye on him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "d001-008", "text": "dentist tues 8.40, then pick up dry cleaning", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tues 8.40", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up dry cleaning", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "d001-009", "text": "so Amir was telling me about this board game cafe he goes to on Wednesdays, he's really into Twilight Imperium, games last like eight hours. He wants to get a group together sometime next month, I said I'm in. Apparently his flatmate Zhang paints all the miniatures and they've got a whole shelf of them. Bring snacks, it's a long one. He also mentioned he's been designing his own game on the side, wants people to playtest it after Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "board game cafe", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Twilight Imperium", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "get a group together", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "paints all the miniatures", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring snacks", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "designing his own game", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playtest", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "d001-010", "text": "Joe's band are playing the Fleece on Saturday night, doors at 8. I'm going with Owen. Ask Joe how it went the next day, he's been rehearsing loads.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playing the Fleece", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Joe how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d001-011", "text": "Alana and Lila's engagement party was meant to be on the 3rd but it's been called off, they've broken up. Lila's staying at her sister's for now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broken up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "d001-012", "text": "Gareth - redundancy confirmed, last day end of Nov. Thinking of retraining as an electrician in the new year, course starts in January if he gets a place. Wife Nora is supportive but worried about money, they've just remortgaged. He was trying to be upbeat but you could tell he's gutted, he's been there 22 years. Ask him how the course application goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of Nov", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Thinking of retraining as an electrician", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "course", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "supportive", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about money", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "been there 22 years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how the course application goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "course application", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "d001-013", "text": "Nikhil reads loads of sci fi, just finished the whole Expanse series. Recommend him Children of Time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikhil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sci fi", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Expanse series", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Recommend him Children of Time", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "d001-014", "text": "Henrik's dog Bjorn has to have an operation on his hip Friday morning. Henrik's a wreck about it, Bjorn's eleven and the vet said there's some risk with the anaesthetic. He's dropping him off at 8 and they'll ring when he's out of theatre. Recovery is about six weeks of crate rest. Text him Friday afternoon to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Bjorn", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a wreck", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he's out of theatre"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Recovery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d001-015", "text": "Layla is training for the Cardiff half in October. Running four times a week, knee is bothering her a bit. Her partner Victor is doing it too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Cardiff half", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Running", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knee is bothering her a bit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Victor", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "d001-016", "text": "Ran into Krisztina at the shop. Her mum's funeral was last Tuesday. Must ring her soon, haven't spoken properly since.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d001-017", "text": "Rhys - Liverpool fan, collects vinyl, mostly 70s soul. Hates jazz.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Liverpool", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "70s soul", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Hates jazz", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "d001-018", "text": "Voice memo. Okay so talked to Katarzyna for ages on the phone tonight. Her grandad, the one in Krakow, died on Monday, really suddenly. She's flying out Wednesday morning and the funeral is the day after she lands, so Thursday. She'll be back sometime the week after. Her boss has been decent about it. Remind me to message her Thursday evening, and maybe drop off some food when she's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after she lands", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d8", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she's back", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "d001-019", "text": "Salma got into the county netball squad!! First session is Saturday at 10. Send congrats", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the county netball squad", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "First session", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 10", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send congrats", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "d001-020", "text": "Aidan's breakup with Ruby was a while ago now but he still seems low. Need to invite him out more. He's into climbing, maybe the bouldering place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a while ago", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "low", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him out", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d001-021", "text": "Ignacio - started learning cello in the summer, has his first little recital the 20th at 7pm at the music school. Scared stiff. His wife Saskia is filming it. He only picked it up because his late dad played, which is sweet. Teacher reckons he's doing really well for an adult beginner. Going to try and make it, if not message him the day before to say good luck and ask Saskia to send me the video afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cello", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first little recital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th at 7pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Scared stiff", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Teacher", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Saskia to send me the video", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}]}
