{"id": "d001-049", "text": "Saskia was made redundant from the agency on the 1st. She's taking a few weeks off then looking for something new after Christmas. Her brother Pieter's helping with her CV. Must send her that job ad Monday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking for something new", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that job ad", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d001-050", "text": "Reza's choir concert at St Mary's is on the 15th at half 7. He's got a solo, he's terrified. I'm going with his sister Noor, we're meeting for food beforehand at 6. He's been rehearsing every night for weeks and his voice teacher thinks it's his best yet but he doesn't believe it. Ask him afterwards how he felt it went, and bring flowers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "choir concert at St Mary's", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th at half 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting for food", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "beforehand at 6", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "voice teacher", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
